#chip 16F1938
#DEFINE DISABLE1637

'Demonstrates the DISABLE1637 escape hatch for the NoMatchingOverload check added at
'build 1637 (see Change1637): the same too-many-parameters Scale() call as
'NoMatchingOverload_TooManyParams_Error.gcb, but with DISABLE1637 defined the
'check is downgraded from a compile error to a warning, so this file must still
'compile successfully (with a warning logged), not fail.

Dim rVar As Integer
rVar = Scale(100, 0, 1023, 0, 255, 0, 999)
